---
import RoundedGrid from "../assets/RoundedGrid.astro";
---
<section class="relative overflow-x-hidden">
  <svg
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 blur-3xl opacity-80"
    width="50%"
    height="100%"
    viewBox="0 0 400 400"
    fill="none"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g clip-path="url(#clip0_17_60)">
      <g filter="url(#filter0_f_17_60)">
        <path d="M128.6 0H0V322.2L332.5 211.5L128.6 0Z" fill="#4D07E3"></path>
        <path d="M0 322.2V400H240H320L332.5 211.5L0 322.2Z" fill="#4C00FF"
        ></path>
        <path d="M320 400H400V78.75L332.5 211.5L320 400Z" fill="#B5BFF1"></path>
        <path d="M400 0H128.6L332.5 211.5L400 78.75V0Z" fill="#7fcef3"></path>
      </g>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <filter
        id="filter0_f_17_60"
        x="-159.933"
        y="-159.933"
        width="719.867"
        height="719.867"
        filterUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
        color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feFlood flood-opacity="0" result="BackgroundImageFix"></feFlood>
        <feBlend
          mode="normal"
          in="SourceGraphic"
          in2="BackgroundImageFix"
          result="shape"></feBlend>
        <feGaussianBlur
          stdDeviation="79.9667"
          result="effect1_foregroundBlur_17_60"></feGaussianBlur>
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>
</section>
<section class="relative border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mt-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
    <div class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">
      <!--<div class="flex items-center justify-center">
        <img alt="Birdsnest" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/birdsnest-2.webp">
        <iframe class="w-full aspect-video rounded-md" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/4cuFbSEM17Q?si=v8xUq456KOL-Be50" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>-->   
      
    
      <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
        OVERVIEW
      </h2>

    <p>
        MudAustralia, an internationally renowned luxury ceramics retailer, embarked on a significant digital transformation journey. They aimed to streamline their e-commerce operations by migrating from WooCommerce to a headless BigCommerce solution while integrating a unified gift card management system. This transformation was essential to enhancing customer experience across multiple touchpoints, including online stores and physical retail locations. 
    </p>
       <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
              <h2 id="account-terms">CHALLENGE</h2>
      </h2>

    <ol>
        <li>
          <h3>Migration Complexity:</h3>
             <p>MudAustralia's existing e-commerce platform, WooCommerce, was being replaced with BigCommerce's headless solution. This migration required meticulous planning to ensure data integrity and functionality were preserved while leveraging the advanced features of BigCommerce.</p>
              </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Gift Card Integration:</h3>
             <p>The existing gift card system needs to integrate seamlessly with DEAR POS, which is used in physical stores, to ensure that gift cards can be redeemed both in-store and online. Additionally, integration with DEAR POS / Cin7 Core (ERP) had to be compatible with Square for payments, adding another layer of complexity.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Multi-Channel and Multi-Currency Management:</h3>
              <p>MudAustralia operates across multiple regions, including the US, UK, and Australia, each with separate accounts. The solution needed to handle multi-currency transactions, manage inventory across multiple stores, and maintain consistent customer experiences regardless of location.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Streamlining Operations:</h3>
              <p>The new system had to support MudAustralia's growth ambitions, including increasing annual recurring revenue (ARR), lifetime value (LTV), average order value (AOV), and repeat purchases, while also offering a rewarding experience for loyal customers.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
        <img alt="MudAustralia" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/mudAus.png">
      </div>
<div class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <RoundedGrid />
  </div>
      <h2 id="account-terms">SOLUTION </h2>
      <h2> Multi-Currency and Multi-Country Gift Voucher Page</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <h3>Headless BigCommerce Integration:</h3>
             <p>MudAustralia successfully migrated from WooCommerce to a headless BigCommerce solution. This transition allowed for greater flexibility in design and functionality, enabling a more personalized and scalable e-commerce experience.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Unified Gift Card Management:</h3>
             <p>The team selected a robust gift card management system that integrated seamlessly with DEAR POS/  Cin7 Core (ERP) and Square. This integration ensured that gift cards could be easily redeemed across all sales channels, providing a cohesive shopping experience. </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Multi-Currency and Multi-Store Handling:</h3>
              <p>The new BigCommerce setup efficiently managed transactions across different currencies and stores. This setup ensured smooth operations in the US, UK, and Australian markets, with centralized control over inventory and sales data.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Enhanced Customer Engagement:</h3>
              <p>With the new system in place, MudAustralia implemented features to reward loyal customers, such as personalized promotions and targeted marketing campaigns. These initiatives aimed to increase ARR, LTV, AOV, and repeat purchases.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center mt-8">
        <img alt="MudAustralia" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="600" height="464" src="/assets/case-study/Mudaustralia1.png">
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
